*** Test Cases ***
Batch Processing
    ${items}    Create List    item1    item2    item3
    ${count}    Set Variable    0
    FOR    ${item}    IN    @{items}
        Process Item    ${item}
        ${count}    Evaluate    ${count} + 1
    END
    Should Be Equal    ${count}    ${3}

*** Keywords ***
Process Item
